{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13213150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13213150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321315001:1":{"text":"ベリーを採ってきましたよ！ついでに、森を荒らす鳥たちも追い払っておきました！","source_cn":"我们采到你说的粉面豆果了！顺便赶跑了那些偷吃的坏鸟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2DEE577C65C9DE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321315002:1":{"text":"それはすごい！じゃあ、みんな心置きなく森に行けるんだな！本当にありがとう！","source_cn":"那可太好了，大伙总算不用为这事发愁了！谢谢各位了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DDD98C1AA6A88B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321315003:1":{"text":"ところで、旅館に送る食材はどこですか？もう発送しちゃいました？","source_cn":"咦，刚才那批要送到白熊旅店的食材呢？已经送过去了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA93DBAFCD01401A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321315004:1":{"text":"ああ。腐りやすい野菜もあったからな。従業員に先に運ばせたんだけど、まさかこんなに早く戻って来るとは。","source_cn":"哦，是啊。那批食材里有一些容易腐坏的菜，我就让手底下的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CE6EF03ACBA392D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321315005:1":{"text":"配達から帰ってきたら、すぐにこのベリーも届けさせるよ。","source_cn":"等他回来之后，我会让他再把你们摘的这些果子送过去的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F7E08979B83F612","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":""